------- FILE bank5.asm LEVEL 1 PASS 2
      1  10000 ????						; ==============================================================================
      2  10000 ????						; Bank 5 - ROOM BANK B (docs/agents/banks.md layout v3). The room-bank code of bank2, assembled again with
      3  10000 ????						; ROOMS_B = 1: byte-identical code at the same addresses, the data windows hold the levels past LEVEL_SPLIT
      4  10000 ????						; (generated/spill_B_*.asm), and the router stub zones hold `jmp body` where A's stubs `sta BK_ROOMS_B`.
      5  10000 ????						; (Until 2026-11-14 the transition frame lived here; it moved to bank4, trans.inc.)
      6  10000 ????						; ==============================================================================
      7  10000 ????		00 01	    ROOMS_B    =	1
